</comment>
                            <comment id="13974640" author="hudson" created="Fri, 18 Apr 2014 23:37:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;SUCCESS: Integrated in Mahout-Quality #2580 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/2580/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/2580/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
