&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;/mahout/trunk/core/src/test/java/org/apache/mahout/common/MockIterator.java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="13974941" author="smarthi" created="Sat, 19 Apr 2014 19:36:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch for SSVD - BtJob, QJob, ABtDenseOutJob, AbtJob, QrFirstStep, SSVDSolver and IOUtils. Please review the same before we commit this. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Not sure how to eliminate OutputCollector unless we rewrite QJob and QRFirstStep which seems like more work and risk. &lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="13975137" author="ssc" created="Sun, 20 Apr 2014 13:32:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;patch looks good, if it passes unit tests, you should commit it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
