                            <comment id="13982242" author="ssc" created="Sun, 27 Apr 2014 08:05:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;What&apos;s the status here?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13982255" author="smarthi" created="Sun, 27 Apr 2014 08:37:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There is no equivalent of CompositeInputFormat in Hadoop 1.x, so not sure if we wanna spend time converting MaxtrixMultiplicationJob, I vote to leave it as is now (Its part of mrlegacy anyways and will soon be replaced by scala dsl equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13982268" author="ssc" created="Sun, 27 Apr 2014 09:13:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;makes sense to me +1&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13982270" author="ssc" created="Sun, 27 Apr 2014 09:17:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We should add a comment to the code though&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
